      "id": "on002893",
      "name": "Auditory-Visual Shift Study",
      "description": "This dataset contains EEG and EOG recordings from younger and older adults performing an interleaved auditory-visual dual-oddball attention-shift task. It was designed to examine how aging affects selective attention and responding to auditory versus visual stimulus streams. Participants performed focus-auditory, focus-visual, and shift-focus conditions, and the data are annotated with HED 8.0.0 in BIDS format.",
